{"lemma":"χωρίς","translit":"chōris","gloss":"without","abbott_smith_html":"<b>χωρίς </b><BR /> <i>adv.</i>, <BR />__1. <b>separately, apart</b>: <ref='Jhn.20.7.'>Jhn.20:7.</ref> <BR /> __2. As prep., with genitive, <BR /> __(a) <b>separate from, apart from, without </b>(practically equiv. to ἄνευ; see Field, <i>Notes</i>, 103): <ref='Mat.13.34'>Mat.13:34</ref>, <ref='Mrk.4.34'>Mrk.4:34</ref>, <ref='Luk.6.49'>Luk.6:49</ref>, <ref='Jhn.1.3; 15.5'>Jhn.1:3 15:5</ref>, <ref='Rom.3.21, 28; 4.6; 7.8-9; 10.14'>Rom.3:21, 28 4:6 7:8-9 10:14</ref>, <ref='1Co.4.8; 11.11'>1Co.4:8 11:11</ref>, <ref='2Co.12.3'>2Co.12:3</ref>, <ref='Eph.2.12'>Eph.2:12</ref>, <ref='Php.2.14'>Php.2:14</ref>, <ref='1Ti.2.8; 5.21'>1Ti.2:8 5:21</ref>, Phm 14, <ref='Heb.4.15; 7.7, 20; 9.7, 18; 9.22, 28; 10.25; 11.6, 40; 12.8, 14'>Heb.4:15 7:7, 20 9:7, 18 9:22, 28 10:25 11:6, 40 12:8, 14</ref> (οὗ χωρίς; see Bl., § 82, 3), <ref='Jas.2.18, 20; 2.26'>Jas.2:18, 20 2:26</ref>; <BR /> __(b) <b>besides</b>: <ref='Mat.14.21; 15.38'>Mat.14:21 15:38</ref>, <ref='2Co.11.28'>2Co.11:28</ref>.†<BR /> (AS)","abbott_smith_is_AS":true,"strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":" at a space, i.e. separately or apart from (often as preposition)","derivation":"adverb from G5561 (χώρα);","kjv_def":"beside, by itself, without"},"lxx_note":null,"count_sbl":41,"count_tr_only":0,"tbesg_key":"G5565","tbesg_other":{},"occurrences":[],"as_refs":{"Jhn.20.7.":["Jhn.20.7"],"Mat.13.34":["Mat.13.34"],"Mrk.4.34":["Mrk.4.34"],"Luk.6.49":["Luk.6.49"],"Jhn.1.3; 15.5":["Jhn.1.3","Jhn.15.5"],"Rom.3.21, 28; 4.6; 7.8-9; 10.14":["Rom.3.21","Rom.3.28","Rom.4.6","Rom.7.8-9","Rom.10.14"],"1Co.4.8; 11.11":["1Co.4.8","1Co.11.11"],"2Co.12.3":["2Co.12.3"],"Eph.2.12":["Eph.2.12"],"Php.2.14":["Php.2.14"],"1Ti.2.8; 5.21":["1Ti.2.8","1Ti.5.21"],"Heb.4.15; 7.7, 20; 9.7, 18; 9.22, 28; 10.25; 11.6, 40; 12.8, 14":["Heb.4.15","Heb.7.7","Heb.7.20","Heb.9.7","Heb.9.18","Heb.9.22","Heb.9.28","Heb.10.25","Heb.11.6","Heb.11.40","Heb.12.8","Heb.12.14"],"Jas.2.18, 20; 2.26":["Jas